## 2. Architecture Overview

```
Frontend (React + Vite)
    │  REST (Axios)
    ▼
Backend (FastAPI)
 ├── /auth          – JWT register/login/me
 ├── /puzzles       – CRUD + block management
 ├── /assignments   – Publish puzzles to cohorts
 ├── /attempts      – Create / submit / pause / resume
 └── /analytics     – Instructor dashboards
    │
    ▼
MongoDB (Motor async driver)
```

