## 3. Block Parsing Logic (New: Every Line is a Block)

> **Change Summary**: The [CodeParser](file:///c:/Users/chitt/Documents/ParsonPuzzle/backend/app/services/code_parser.py#12-251) service now treats **each individual line** as its own block for certain puzzle types, while also supporting intelligent multi-line grouping (AST-based for Python, indentation-based for pseudocode). The [_finalize_block](file:///c:/Users/chitt/Documents/ParsonPuzzle/backend/app/services/code_parser.py#181-197) function assembles the final block objects with `correct_position`, `indentation_level`, [is_comment](file:///c:/Users/chitt/Documents/ParsonPuzzle/backend/app/services/code_parser.py#214-219), and `line_number` fields.

### [code_parser.py](file:///c:/Users/chitt/Documents/ParsonPuzzle/backend/app/services/code_parser.py) — [CodeParser](file:///c:/Users/chitt/Documents/ParsonPuzzle/backend/app/services/code_parser.py#12-251)

The [parse_code](file:///c:/Users/chitt/Documents/ParsonPuzzle/backend/app/services/code_parser.py#15-34) entry point tries Python AST first; if that fails (e.g. pseudocode), it falls back to an indentation-based grouper. The key rule is: **every line becomes its own block by default**; lines are only merged if they belong to the same control-flow construct (e.g. the body of an `if` or [for](file:///c:/Users/chitt/Documents/ParsonPuzzle/backend/app/services/evaluation_engine.py#117-147)). Comments always get their own block regardless.

```python
@staticmethod
def parse_code(code_text: str) -> List[Dict[str, Any]]:
    lines = code_text.split('\n')
    try:
        tree = ast.parse(code_text)
        return CodeParser._parse_with_ast(code_text, tree, lines)
    except SyntaxError:
        return CodeParser._parse_with_indentation(lines)
```

Each parsed block is then stamped with `correct_position`, `indentation_level`, [is_comment](file:///c:/Users/chitt/Documents/ParsonPuzzle/backend/app/services/code_parser.py#214-219), and `line_number` before being saved to MongoDB via [generate_blocks_from_code](file:///c:/Users/chitt/Documents/ParsonPuzzle/backend/app/services/code_parser.py#221-251).

