## 6. Backend API Routes

### Auth — `/auth`
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/auth/register` | Register new user (Student/Instructor) |
| POST | `/auth/login` | Login → returns JWT bearer token |
| GET | `/auth/me` | Get current authenticated user |

#### JWT Auth Dependency
```python
async def get_current_user(credentials: HTTPAuthorizationCredentials = Depends(security)):
    payload = AuthService.decode_access_token(credentials.credentials)
    user_data = await collection.find_one({"user_id": payload.get("sub")})
    return User(**user_data)
```

### Puzzles — `/puzzles`
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/puzzles` | Create puzzle (instructor only) |
| GET | `/puzzles/{id}` | Get puzzle by ID |
| PUT | `/puzzles/{id}` | Update puzzle |
| POST | `/puzzles/{id}/blocks` | Add blocks to a puzzle |
| GET | `/puzzles/{id}/blocks` | Get blocks (hides `correct_position` from students) |
| GET | `/puzzles` | Get all puzzles by current instructor |

### Attempts — `/attempts`
| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---|---|---|
| POST | `/attempts` | Create/start attempt |
| POST | `/attempts/{id}/submit` | Submit and evaluate |
| GET | `/attempts/{id}` | Get attempt by ID |
| GET | `/attempts` | List attempts (filtered by user/assignment) |
| POST | `/attempts/{id}/pause` | Save progress and pause |
| POST | `/attempts/{id}/resume` | Resume paused attempt |

